{
  "id": "lo09RetrySweep00",
  "name": "LeadOps 09 · Retry sweeper",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Retry sweeper\nEvery 2 minutes: replays failed events whose back-off has elapsed (2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 60 min), events accepted but never processed (for example n8n restarted mid-flight) and events stuck in processing. After MAX_ATTEMPTS the event is marked dead and the operator is alerted.\n\nManual replay: `UPDATE leadops.inbox SET status='failed', attempts=0, next_retry_at=now() WHERE id=...`",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3fcfccb1-4254-576a-a0e1-9ae38a9c04d5",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -440,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "eed5d17d-06ed-5faf-8a96-cd5b9326b11f",
      "name": "Every 2 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id AS inbox_id FROM leadops.inbox\n WHERE (status = 'failed' AND next_retry_at <= now())\n    OR (status = 'pending' AND received_at < now() - interval '3 minutes')\n    OR (status = 'processing' AND locked_at < now() - interval '10 minutes')\n ORDER BY received_at\n LIMIT 25;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "da3666db-5262-5930-9a3c-c410e473055d",
      "name": "Events to retry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "loCredPostgres01",
          "name": "LeadOps DB"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "92d254ec-5e76-5ddf-ad69-59ea41564e35",
      "name": "Loop over events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
